"ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນ smb.conf ຄືນເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ:\n"
"%1"

#. 1st part of an error message:
#. winbind cannot provide user information if the host
#. is not in a domain
#: src/include/samba-client/dialogs.rb:873
