#. membership dialog help (common part 3/4), %1 is separator (e.g. '\')
#: src/include/samba-client/routines.rb:511
#, ycp-format
msgid ""
"<p><b>Allow Users to Share Their Directories</b> enables members of the "
"group in <b>Permitted Group</b> to share directories they own with other "
"users. For example, <tt>users</tt> for a local scope or <tt>DOMAIN%1Users</"
"tt> for a domain scope.  The user also must make sure that the file system "
"permissions allow access.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ແຊຣ໌ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຂອງພວກເຂົາ</b> ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສະມາຊິກຂອງກຸ່ມໃນ <b>ກຸ່ມທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາ"
"ດ</b> ສາມາດແຊຣ໌ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ພວກເຂົາເປັນເຈົ້າຂອງກັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ອື່ນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, <tt>users</tt> ສຳລັບຂອບເຂ"
"ດໃນເຄື່ອງ ຫຼື <tt>DOMAIN%1Users</tt> ສຳລັບຂອບເຂດໂດເມນ. ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕ້ອງໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າຍັງໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າການອະນຸຍ"
"າດຂອງລະບົບໄຟລ໌ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ນຳ.</p>"

#. membership dialog help (common part 3/4)
#: src/include/samba-client/routines.rb:517
msgid ""
"<p>With <b>Maximum Number of Shares</b>, limit the total amount of shares "
"that may be created.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ດ້ວຍ <b>ຈຳນວນການແຊຣ໌ສູງສຸດ</b>, ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດຈຳນວນທັງໝົດຂອງການແຊຣ໌ທີ່ສາມາດສ້າງໄດ້.</p>"

#. membership dialog help common part
#: src/include/samba-client/routines.rb:522
msgid ""
"<p>To permit access to user shares without authentication, enable <b>Allow "
"Guest Access</b>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງການແຊຣ໌ຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງຢັ້ງຢືນຕົວຕົນ, ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ <b>ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ແຂກເຂົ້າເຖິ"
"ງ</b>.</p>"

#. help text for PAM Mount table
#: src/include/samba-client/routines.rb:531
msgid ""
"<p>In the table <b>Mount Server Directories</b>, you can specify server\n"
"directories (such as home directory) which should be locally mounted when "
"the\n"
"user is logged in. If mounting should be user-specific, specify <b>User\n"
"Name</b> for the selected rule. Otherwise, the directory is mounted for each "
"user. For more information, see pam_mount.conf manual page.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ໃນຕາຕະລາງ <b>ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຂອງເຊີເວີ</b>, ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຂອງເຊີເວີ\n"
"(ເຊັ່ນ ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກ) ທີ່ຄວນຈະຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (mount) ເຂົ້າໃນເຄື່ອງເມື່ອ\n"
"ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຂົ້າລະບົບ. ຫາກຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເປັນແບບສະເພາະຜູ້ໃຊ້, ໃຫ້ລະບຸ <b>ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້</b>\n"
"ສຳລັບກົດທີ່ເລືອກ. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຈະຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສຳລັບທຸກຜູ້ໃຊ້. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ເບິ່ງໜ້າຄູ່ມື "
"pam_mount.conf.</p>"

#. help text for PAM Mount table: example
#: src/include/samba-client/routines.rb:538
msgid ""
"<p>For example, you may use <tt>/home/%(DOMAIN_USER)</tt> value for "
"<b>Remote Path</b>, <tt>~/</tt> value for <b>Local Mount Point</b> to mount "
"the home directory, together with a value <tt>user=%(DOMAIN_USER)</tt> as a "
"part of <b>Options</b>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ຕົວຢ່າງ, ທ່ານອາດໃຊ້ຄ່າ <tt>/home/%(DOMAIN_USER)</tt> ສຳລັບ <b>ເສັ້ນທາງໄລຍະໄກ</b>, "
"ຄ່າ <tt>~/</tt> ສຳລັບ <b>ຈຸດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃນເຄື່ອງ</b> ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກ, ພ້ອມກັບຄ່າ <tt>"
"user=%(DOMAIN_USER)</tt> ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງ <b>ຕົວເລືອກ</b>.</p>"

#. help text for kerberos method option
#: src/include/samba-client/routines.rb:546
msgid ""
"<p>The value of <b>Kerberos Method</b> defines how kerberos tickets are "
"verified. When <b>Single Sing-on for SSH</b> is used, the default Kerberos "
"Method set by YaST is <tt>secrets and keytab</tt>. See smb.conf manual page "
"for details.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ຄ່າຂອງ <b>ວິທີການ Kerberos</b> ກຳນົດວິທີການກວດສອບທິກເກັດ kerberos. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ <b>ການລົງຊື່"
"ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ຄັ້ງດຽວສຳລັບ SSH</b>, ວິທີການ Kerberos ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຕັ້ງໂດຍ YaST ແມ່ນ <tt>secrets and "
"keytab</tt>. ເບິ່ງໜ້າຄູ່ມື smb.conf ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດ.</p>"

